      "role": "user",
      "content": "embedding that feeling of \"embracing\" it feels impossible right now. it doesn't feel like a step toward joy, it just feels like... a void. like there's nothing left to find. sometimes i just stare at the wall and wish the noise in my head and this heavy nothingness would just stop. i just want to feel something real, or i just want the blankness to be gone. it's just constant.",
